name: Shark
realm: sea
# Island survival's deep hunter. Eats only dead cells: head for the nearest one (3 S),
# collect, and bomb the nearest foreign cell in range (B, empty stack) on the way, so
# anything that strays near becomes food. Big: a row of fat under it soaks up hits and
# gives copy errors room to make armor (K) for the climb upward.
